# Mutation plan for the 2026-09-07 cloud and connected-workspaces group — twenty-five routes.
#
#   scripts/mutate-batch.sh scripts/mutations/cloud-workspaces.plan
#
# Three neighbouring families, three shapes, and the mistakes are all cross-contamination:
#
#   * `/cloud` refuses with **400**, everything around it with 501;
#   * `RequireRemoteId` is **emptiness only** (web/context.go:745) while `RequireTeamId` and
#     `RequireChannelId` in the adjacent file are `IsValidId` — the port applied the second to four
#     routes that use the first, and the parity suite caught it;
#   * two `/sharedchannels` routes consult the service **before** the permission check, so an
#     unauthorised caller gets 501 rather than 403 — the opposite of every route in
#     `remote_cluster.go`;
#   * `getRemoteClusterInfo` has no permission check at all.
#
# The last two lines are the no-op controls and must SURVIVE.
